mission "A Doctor's Passage"
    category "side"
    name "A Doctor's Passage"
    description "Take a physician and his medical case from San Telmo to Stormhaven."
    source "San Telmo"
    destination "Stormhaven"
    reward 420
    speaker offer "Dr. Mateo Ruiz"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster Vale"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster Vale"
    on offer
        conversation
            `A physician in a weather-darkened coat asks whether your cabin is dry. He carries a leather case and a rolled blanket.`
            `"Stormhaven has had a fever in the lower quarter. Their usual doctor is laid up himself. I have been asked to help, but the passenger packets are full and the militia will not spare a launch. I can pay for a berth and keep out of your crew's way."`
            choice
                `"Come aboard, doctor. We will make room."`
                    accept
                `"I am not taking passengers today."`
                    close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A Doctor's Passage. Take Dr. Mateo Ruiz from San Telmo to Stormhaven."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Harbourmaster Vale sends two porters for the doctor's case. "You have brought the right man at the right time. The infirmary has been asking after him since dawn."`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Dr. Ruiz leaves a sealed note and a modest purse with the harbourmaster. Before he goes, he turns back to you. "You did not merely carry a passenger. You carried a day's worth of hope. Fair winds."`
